  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#46239\", \"PowerToys#46589\", \"PowerToys#46478\"], \"answer\": \"This auto-hide request for the Command Palette Dock has been reported before. PowerToys#46239 is the main ticket that tracks it. The other tickets were closed as duplicates of it. The request is for the dock to hide, reappear when the mouse reaches the screen edge, and not shrink the usable screen area. There is no setting for this yet, so add your vote or your KDE-style ideas to #46239. Those ideas are the configurable hover delay, a non-interactive device-info overlay and nicer graphs. Your device-info graph feedback is a separate point, so mention it there as well. Related tickets: #46161 tracks keeping the dock on top, and #46589 also covers auto-hide.\"}",
